cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this case study, please cite it as below.
title: "1D Linear Advection — Numerical Case Study"
authors:
  - family-names: Prada Malagon
    given-names: Juan David
    email: pradamalagonjd@gmail.com
abstract: >
  A compact scientific-computing case study that solves the one-dimensional
  linear advection equation with explicit finite-difference schemes in C,
  verifies against the exact traveling-wave solution, and analyzes
  convergence, scheme stability, and numerical diffusion in Python.
keywords:
  - advection
  - finite differences
  - upwind scheme
  - Lax-Wendroff
  - scientific computing
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
url: https://github.com/juandapradam12/1DLinearAdvectionEquation
